<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Disconnect from the server and return to the connect screen. Other users see your optional quit message in all channels you were in."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_question}>{dgettext("help_commands", "When to Use It")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Use it when you are done chatting and want to leave every channel at once. To leave only one channel and stay connected, use %{command} instead.",
    command: "/part"
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_code}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Syntax")}</.help_h4>
<pre>{dgettext("help_commands", "/quit [message]")}</pre>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tag}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Parameters")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <code>message</code> {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "— Optional goodbye message shown to other users."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_commands", "How It Works")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "You are disconnected from the server and returned to the connect screen. All your channel memberships end, and other users see a quit notification with your optional message. Your session is fully ended — to rejoin, you'll need to connect again from the connect screen."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "In each channel you were in, the other members see a line that you left, with your message in brackets after it. If you give no message, a default reason is used. The app does not reconnect you or rejoin your channels by itself after you quit."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Rules & Limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_commands", "Anyone can use it. No channel or server status is needed.")}
  </li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_commands", "A message longer than 200 characters is cut to 200")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_commands",
      "The message is shown in your channels, not in private conversations"
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Examples")}</.help_h4>
<pre>/quit
/quit Goodnight everyone!</pre>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_commands", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="cmd-part">{dgettext("help_commands", "/part")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-quit-message">
    {dgettext("help_commands", "Quit Messages")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-auto-reconnect">
    {dgettext("help_commands", "Auto-Reconnect")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
